	('sher-shah-suri-1540-sur', 'sher-shah-suri-1540-sur', 'Sher Shah Suri', 'Sur Sultan', 'sur', 'time_as_ruler', 'Farid al-Din Sher Shah, better known as Sher Shah Suri, was the Sultan of Hindustan also known by his title Sultan Adil, as the first Sur Emperor, from 1540 until his death in 1545. Prior to his ascension, he also served as the regent, and later Sultan of Bihar and Bengal.', 'ruler-sher-shah-suri', 1540, 1545, 'about', 'about', 'likely');
